'''Bring it On!''' (かかってきやがれ！, ''Kakatte Kiyagare!'', '''Bring It On!''') is a 1-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 12.7 Update|Update 12.7]].

==Effect==
Unit Defense UP (Sm): Cats' health increases by 10%.

